! <solver:p610_t3>
! NAFEMS-style LE11 thick-cylinder (axial-restrained, plane strain) (T3, plane strain, Lame thick-cylinder)
!
! Quarter-symmetric thick cylinder under internal pressure p = 100 kPa.
!   a = 1 m, b = 2 m, E = 1000000 kPa, nu = 0.25
!   nr x ns = 8 x 12 (192 T3 elements, 117 nodes)
!
! BCs (symmetry):
!   bottom edge (y=0, j=0):  uy fixed
!   left   edge (x=0, j=ns): ux fixed
!
! Loading:
!   Internal pressure applied as mode-0 sigma=(-p, -p, 0) traction on the
!   inner arc; T=sigma.n=-p*n is independent of edge orientation.
!
! Closed-form (Lame, plane strain, tension-positive):
!   sigma_rr(r) = p*a^2/(b^2-a^2) * (1 - b^2/r^2)
!   sigma_tt(r) = p*a^2/(b^2-a^2) * (1 + b^2/r^2)
!   sigma_zz    = nu*(sigma_rr + sigma_tt)   [plane strain]
! <BEGIN:AnalysisOptions>
! failure_criterion MohrCoulomb
! material_type Isotropic
! mesh_type T3
! solver_executable p610_t3_elastoplastic
! expected_radial_mode lame_pressurized_cylinder
! expected_radial_inner_a 1
! expected_radial_outer_b 2
! expected_radial_pressure_kPa 100
! expected_radial_nu 0.25
! expected_radial_center_x 0
! expected_radial_center_y 0
! expected_radial_plane_strain true
! expected_radial_tolerance_kPa 25.0
! tolerance_kPa 25.0
! <END:AnalysisOptions>
